          "description": "Check story comprehension in this fun activity set to lo-fi beats. We'll be drawing the beginning, middle, and end of a story you've read or listened to.\n\nThis works with picture or chapter books, decodable reading passages, you name it. You can even do this after listening to a Yoto card!\n\nRequires NO reading or writing, so perfect for mixed aged groups like a 4 year old and a 12 year old!",
